<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cambridge Heart.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cambridge Heart.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns started coverage of Cambridge Heart Inc with an attractive rating, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 25/32 at 8-25/32.</p>
